1
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,795
Octogésimo lugar—

2
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:09,116
Chen Dayou, de Qingzhou!

3
00:00:09,291 --> 00:00:09,992
Começando do último

4
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:11,469
para cima?

5
00:00:12,232 --> 00:00:12,946
Oitenta nomes,

6
00:00:13,798 --> 00:00:15,626
é só esperar.

7
00:00:15,686 --> 00:00:16,550
Ora,

8
00:00:16,698 --> 00:00:20,160
O letrado Xu também veio ver a lista?

9
00:00:21,736 --> 00:00:23,366
Se ele passar,

10
00:00:23,691 --> 00:00:25,156
eu ando de costas!

11
00:00:25,573 --> 00:00:26,162
Senhor Zhou,

12
00:00:27,044 --> 00:00:28,051
amarre bem os sapatos.

13
00:00:28,122 --> 00:00:28,921
Combinado,

14
00:00:29,177 --> 00:00:30,169
de costas, a rua inteira.

15
00:00:30,943 --> 00:00:32,256
Todo mundo ouviu.

16
00:00:39,138 --> 00:00:40,181
O riscado é…

17
00:00:41,731 --> 00:00:42,892
o Examinador Feng!

18
00:00:43,781 --> 00:00:47,117
R-riscar um examinador,

19
00:00:47,198 --> 00:00:48,836
não é nada.

20
00:00:50,741 --> 00:00:51,413
Riscaram o examinador,

21
00:00:51,584 --> 00:00:52,376
e a lista?

22
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,173
Décimo lugar—

23
00:00:54,244 --> 00:00:57,380
Lin Shi'an, da cidade!

24
00:00:57,844 --> 00:00:59,239
Terceiro lugar—

25
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:02,787
Li Shouzheng, de Qingzhou!

26
00:01:04,429 --> 00:01:05,748
Segundo lugar—

27
00:01:05,807 --> 00:01:09,081
Zhao Wenyuan, da cidade!

28
00:01:09,171 --> 00:01:11,489
Ha ha ha!

29
00:01:12,382 --> 00:01:14,528
Nem entre os três primeiros!

30
00:01:15,068 --> 00:01:15,912
Lê logo, anda…

31
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:19,632
Não está nervoso?

32
00:01:19,690 --> 00:01:19,971
Estou.

33
00:01:20,324 --> 00:01:21,856
Minhas mãos estão suando.

34
00:01:23,246 --> 00:01:24,624
O primeiro do exame—

35
00:01:24,833 --> 00:01:26,371
Liuxi, condado de Qingshui,

36
00:01:27,963 --> 00:01:29,712
Xu Yan!

37
00:01:29,829 --> 00:01:30,201
…Eu?

38
00:01:33,029 --> 00:01:33,403
Passou!

39
00:01:33,907 --> 00:01:34,455
O primeiro!

40
00:01:35,155 --> 00:01:36,813
Eu sabia.

41
00:01:37,030 --> 00:01:38,751
Missão do exame provincial concluída.

42
00:01:39,549 --> 00:01:42,610
Recompensa: impressão com tipos móveis.

43
00:01:42,687 --> 00:01:43,633
Tipos móveis…

44
00:01:44,132 --> 00:01:45,725
preciso achar um gravador.

45
00:01:47,354 --> 00:01:48,183
Licença…

46
00:01:48,263 --> 00:01:49,947
Licença…

47
00:01:50,011 --> 00:01:50,726
Só na metade,

48
00:01:51,216 --> 00:01:51,936
força, Senhor Zhou!

49
00:01:52,899 --> 00:01:53,796
Eu…

50
00:01:53,854 --> 00:01:55,677
Tá bom, eu ando!

51
00:01:56,621 --> 00:01:57,302
A rua toda,

52
00:01:57,718 --> 00:01:59,722
nem um passo a menos.

53
00:02:01,753 --> 00:02:02,248
Pessoal,

54
00:02:02,312 --> 00:02:03,158
alegria pra todos!

55
00:02:03,476 --> 00:02:04,500
Xu Yan!

56
00:02:04,637 --> 00:02:05,206
Aqui!

57
00:02:07,682 --> 00:02:08,221
O que foi?

58
00:02:09,059 --> 00:02:09,730
Esta noite,

59
00:02:10,569 --> 00:02:11,444
tenho algo pra te dizer.
